      "message": "We might not need DrawWriter to take care of this logic, it could always set the buffers on the DrawDispatcher.\n\nMtlCommandBuffer already has logic to only actually record binds when there is a change. We could do something similar in the DrawPass\u0027 dispatcher as well.",
